1100
00:36:57,757 --> 00:36:58,800
- Yeah, yeah.

1101
00:36:58,883 --> 00:36:59,801
Didn't they tell you?

1102
00:36:59,884 --> 00:37:02,429
I'm going to be
observing the whole time.

1103
00:37:02,512 --> 00:37:04,347
- 'Cause I don't
usually like, you know,

1104
00:37:04,431 --> 00:37:06,683
when journalists
hang around the set

1105
